    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid farewell to the mundane movie-watching experience! CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/ee16b3ca1dae0899915094473fe70a3f.avif?t=1752483789\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the villa of your own design, you can freely construct your private home theater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content. With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of natural environments for players to select from, such as islands, waterfalls, and snow-capped mountains. Players can also modify lighting and sky settings to tailor the ambiance of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/5e27653492d2223f5ca35da7aef7dae0.avif?t=1752483789\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting and Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive lighting and fireplace flames allow you to switch and adjust the atmosphere to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panoramic photo access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can further enhance their virtual reality environments by loading local panoramic photos as backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid farewell to the mundane movie-watching experience! CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/ee16b3ca1dae0899915094473fe70a3f.avif?t=1752483789\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the villa of your own design, you can freely construct your private home theater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content. With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of natural environments for players to select from, such as islands, waterfalls, and snow-capped mountains. Players can also modify lighting and sky settings to tailor the ambiance of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/5e27653492d2223f5ca35da7aef7dae0.avif?t=1752483789\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting and Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive lighting and fireplace flames allow you to switch and adjust the atmosphere to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panoramic photo access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can further enhance their virtual reality environments by loading local panoramic photos as backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.poster.avif?t=1752483789\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.webm?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.mp4?t=1752483789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "CinemaLandVR is a VR game specifically designed for immersive cinemas. It offers a diverse range of architectural modules and an extensive selection of furniture. Players can build their own dream villa in the embrace of nature, creating a magical and immersive movie-watching experience.",
